        <item>
            <title>0.11.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:26:56 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>255</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Supply 0.11.0</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Much faster colour correction</b> — dragging a slider now updates the preview instantly instead of lagging behind. Playback and scrubbing are smoother too, especially with a grade applied.</li>
  <li><b>Smoother clip switching</b> — clicking between clips no longer flashes black; the previous frame stays up until the new one is ready.</li>
  <li><b>Categorize</b> — automatically sort clips by supplier (ceremony, speeches, first dance, etc.) using on-device analysis. Find it under Clips ▸ Categorize….</li>
  <li>Numerous behind-the-scenes performance and stability improvements to the preview pipeline.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
